// The Core surface the ledger scores beyond Core.jet's module exports.
// Read by Tools/agent/check-core-surface-ledger.mjs; this file is its only
// home for these rows.
//
// `fixed_sig <module> { member, ... }` names the Core members with a typed
// fixed signature. Members that Core.jet does not export become ledger rows
// of kind `fixed_sig`.
// `methods <Container> { method, ... }` names the built-in receiver and
// static methods a ledger container ships. A method name may contain spaces.
//
// The rows were frozen at the Rust-removal cutover from the bootstrap
// checker's `core_fixed_sig_raw` table and its `builtin_method_return`
// dispatch tree. Update them by hand when one of these members is added or
// removed.

